  "description": {
   "en": "Gaku Kitada is a prodigy in Mathematics and a scholarship holder at Wels Private Academy, a renowned institution with a long history in the International Mathematical Olympiad. After a series of unfortunate events, he meets Kai Asakura, a culinarian prodigy with his own catering business. What does the future hold for these two geniuses, and how do their paths intertwine with each other's?",
   "ja": "「俺たちは、料理をもって神に挑む。」数学者を志すも、その道に挫折した高校生・北田 岳（きただがく）。夢を失い、学食のアルバイトで無為な日々を過ごす彼に、謎の若き天才シェフ・朝倉 海（あさくらかい）との運命的な出会いは、突然訪れる――。２人がめぐり逢い、「数学」と「料理」が交わる時、未知の世界への扉が開く！！"
  },
